config:
  theme: redux
---
sequenceDiagram
  participant Stripe
  participant PaySvc as Payment Service
  participant DV as Dataverse
  participant SB as Service Bus
  participant Eng as Evaluation Service
  participant PG as PostgreSQL
  participant Cache as Redis and FusionCache
  Stripe->>PaySvc: invoice.paid or subscription.updated
  PaySvc->>DV: write Order and Payment Schedule
  DV->>SB: change event via service endpoint, for contactId and sector
  SB->>Eng: deliver
  Eng->>DV: read Order, Product Entitlements, Verification, Payment Schedule via ACL
  Eng->>Eng: validate and resolve, positive-only, failures resolved pre-write
  Eng->>DV: upsert resolved entitlements, Phase 2 record
  Eng->>PG: upsert projection, Phase 3 record
  Eng->>Cache: invalidate keys for contact